# Elegy Acolyte's Void: "a spell was warped this turn" means cast for its warp cost (CR 702.185c), not any spell and not the
# same card cast for its ordinary mana cost. Turn 3 Bot1 hard-casts Pinnacle Emissary for {1}{U}{R} (Mox Ruby, Mox Sapphire,
# Mox Jet) instead of warping it: nothing is warped, nothing nonland leaves the battlefield, so no Robot is created and the
